    "AppJavaSetup.gameRequirement" : {
      "comment" : "Shown in the Java requirement prompt before launch or installation: Launching “%1$@” requires compatible Java, but no suitable local version was found (recommended: Java %2$@, %3$@). Download and continue? You can also choose existing Java.. %1$@ is the instance name; %2$@ is the recommended Java major version; %3$@ is the required CPU architecture.",
